### ae8240a
breaking(api): rename ComputedValue to DerivedValue

Name the type after what derive returns: a derived value with value,
pending and the reactive switch. "Computed value" is the term the
glossary avoids, so the core's doc comments, the benchmark, the agent
docs, the README and the hooks roadmap follow the rename and say
"derived value", "pending" and "computation" in prose. The shape and
both derive overloads are unchanged; a new test pins the exported type
as the annotation of a derive result.

